{"parse": {"title": "暗色带编织-03", "pageid": 97164, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E8%89%B2%E5%B8%A6%E7%BC%96%E7%BB%87-02\" title=\"暗色带编织-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">暗色带编织-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E8%89%B2%E5%B8%A6%E7%BC%96%E7%BB%87-04\" title=\"暗色带编织-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">暗色带编织</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> </div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>命运……是的，我应该想到它，命运。一个宏大而又与每个人息息相关的主题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>就像这个充满矛盾的国家，它的命运也应该……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>咳咳，既然如此，让我们正式进入本次沙龙的环节吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>善于察言观色的诗社成员连忙打断了眼睑湿润的奥克塔维奥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>有谁愿意就这个主题分享一些故事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>无论是亲身经历还是撰写的故事，咱们得让这次沙龙热闹起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>如果没人愿意说的话，我也可以勉为其难地再讲一遍我横穿墨西哥边境的命运之旅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哗啦——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寡言的男性率先站起身，所有人的视线都集中于他那高大颧骨下的阴霾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个意料之外的转折。<br />没有人注意到人群身后的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>我的前半辈子是个银行柜员。有一天，我坐在柜台的玻璃罩里，望着一沓接一沓的支票、文件、传单，我忽然觉得这是一场无期徒刑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>我辞了职，打算回家写点儿什么。妻子知道了之后，起初是大吵大闹，之后是微缩文明的世纪冷战，最后是一个单方面的驱逐令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>我喝了个大醉，在街上给一个殴打乞丐的混账军官结结实实地来了一拳，后面的事儿不记得了。恢复意识以后，我就已经来到了这儿，一个比家更像家的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>理想家先生喂我喝了点儿水，并建议我给阿莱夫写信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>我照他说的做了。我写了信，问了问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>两周之后，我收到了回信。上面只有一行字，我仍在试图领悟其中的道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div><i>“在人生的有限时间里，存在一个无限延伸的楼梯，而终点，不过是一片寂静的水域。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>胡利奥，我都不知道你有这么一段精彩的过去。之前怎么没听你提起过？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我也不知道……原来你也给阿莱夫写过信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>奥克塔维奥，也许你的课题是对的。像你这样充满朝气的青年作家，应该怀着改变社会的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>不要像我一样，到了这个岁数才真正决定拿起那杆笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>……噢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>代理主持人已沉迷在故事会中，逐渐忘怀了那个原本严肃的主题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>很好，接下来总归轮到我来分享横穿墨西哥边境……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>省省吧！你那点儿故事我都听过七八个版本的了。甚至还没算上短篇小说集里的那五篇——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>你把一个故事写了整整五遍，其差异性不过只是视角上的转换！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>重复性叙事的确也是文学批评中的一个重要课题——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>余下的时间里，囚犯陷入了喧哗与骚动的故事会中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯有德洛丝医生默念了一遍那个唐突的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>“阿、莱、夫”……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>胡利奥先生的往事是一份意料之外的收获，它很适合编撰为一本传记。在下一次的投稿中，我会将它作为一份珍重的材料使用。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>回过神来，这场文学沙龙令我已经逐渐忘记了自己正身处监狱之中的事实。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>我会在写作中毫无保留地描绘我所认知与经历的一切。至于他们是否是真正的囚犯，这将交由敬爱的读者们来评判。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>那时，我并未听由直觉去询问他们进入监狱的理由，而是如他们一般，思考着更为纯粹的事物。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>如今，当我回忆起整段旅程，那些盘根错节的魔鬼涎呈现出一种相互联结的构造。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在沙龙进行得如火如荼之时，阴影中浮现出一张脸庞，其中只有笑容清晰可见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>我很少以旁观者的视角，来接纳沙龙每一种别有趣味的象征、每一个细枝末节的隐喻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>现实与非现实的桥梁，典型与非典型的诗意！<br />这正是我在创办之初对于“美洲诗社”的设想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新到来的囚犯吸引了医生的注意力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>现实与非现实……您指的是纪实文学与虚构文学的差异性吗？<br />我想，我还未能完全理解您的深意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>噢，但你至少能够理解其中的部分，不是吗？由此可见，我们共同行走在一条追求始终如一的美学的道路上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>我们是文学王国的臣民，我们是追逐第一束抵达新大陆边界的光的观星者，我们是在树下望着纯粹的理想之果而流涕的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>——以创办者的名义，我诚挚地邀请您加入<i><b>美洲诗社</b></i>，成为我们中的一员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-518512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-518512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-518512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>加入……<i><b>美洲诗社</b></i>？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个无可挑剔的绅士礼，一份难以拒绝的盛情邀约。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里的一切都别有奥妙——眼前的文学盛会、萦绕着奇异氛围的建筑，还有那位神秘的收信人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不可多得的良机，医生对自己说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>……我愿意答应您的邀请，参与各位的集会与活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>但我还有一个问题，理想家先生。<br />——您自称为创办者，我猜您就是那位“理想家”，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">理想家：</div><div>但问无妨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>您能告诉我关于“阿莱夫”的事情吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "暗色带编织-03"}}